---
import { page, asset } from '../utils/paths';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Large Format Print" active="large-format-print">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">

      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="hero-eyebrow">Large Print</span>

        <h1>Big Ideas. Bigger <span>Impact</span></h1>

        <p>
          High-quality large format printing designed to get your brand noticed.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href={page('contact/')} class="hero-btn">
            Get a Quote
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <picture>
          <source media="(min-width:992px)" srcset={asset('assets/images/9.large-print/hero.png')}>
          <img
            src={asset('assets/images/9.large-print/hero-mobile.png')}
            alt="Professional promotional banner stands">
        </picture>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <div class="page-content">
   
    <section>
      <h2>Large Format Print</h2>
    
      <p>
        Make a lasting impression with professional
        large format printing from Efexacademy. Whether
        you're preparing for an exhibition, promoting
        your business, or transforming a commercial
        space, we provide
        <strong>high-quality digital printing solutions
        with a fast, efficient, and reliable service</strong>.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        We understand the importance of clear, vibrant
        graphics in communicating your message and
        strengthening your brand identity. From
        eye-catching promotional banners to large-scale
        exhibition graphics, our printing services
        are designed to deliver professional results
        across a wide range of applications.
      </p>
    
      <h3>Versatile Printing Solutions</h3>
    
      <p>
        Our large format printing services cover an
        extensive selection of promotional and display
        products, including indoor and outdoor banners,
        mesh graphics, printed vinyls, flags, placards,
        and exhibition display panels. We also provide
        graphic solutions for modular exhibition systems,
        allowing businesses to refresh their displays
        without replacing the entire structure.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Whether you need a single promotional graphic
        or a coordinated collection of branded displays,
        we can help you select suitable materials and
        finishes for your intended environment.
        Our aim is to provide practical, visually
        appealing solutions that complement your
        branding and presentation requirements.
      </p>
    
      <h3>Replacement Graphics &amp; Display Re-Skinning</h3>
    
      <p>
        Already own an exhibition stand or display
        system? There's no need to invest in an
        entirely new setup when your branding or
        promotional message changes.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Efexacademy can supply replacement graphic
        panels for existing exhibition displays,
        including systems that were not originally
        purchased from us. Our re-skinning service
        provides a cost-effective way to update
        your presentation while making continued
        use of your existing display equipment.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        We also provide printed graphics for shell
        scheme exhibition walling, helping businesses
        transform standard exhibition spaces into
        professional, branded environments.
      </p>
    
      <h3>Rigid Boards, Signage &amp; Specialist Materials</h3>
    
      <p>
        In addition to flexible display graphics,
        we offer direct printing onto a variety of
        rigid materials, including Foamex, Correx,
        and Dibond. These materials are suitable
        for a range of applications, from temporary
        promotional signage and exhibition panels
        to more durable commercial displays.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        For reception areas, offices, retail interiors,
        and decorative installations, we also provide
        specialist vinyl and inkjet printing solutions.
        These include vinyl graphics applied to glass
        and printed acrylic panels, with stand-off
        fixings available to create a clean,
        contemporary presentation.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Whether you're looking to enhance a reception
        area, introduce branded wall graphics, or
        create distinctive business signage, we can
        help you explore materials and finishes
        suited to your project.
      </p>
    
      <h3>Need Something Specific?</h3>
    
      <p>
        <strong>If it's not in stock, we'll do our
        best to source it for you.</strong>
        We understand that every project is different,
        and standard products don't always meet
        every requirement. If you're looking for
        a particular material, display format,
        or specialist printing solution, speak
        to us about your ideas.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        From initial enquiries to finished graphics,
        we're here to help you find a practical
        solution that meets your needs, budget,
        and timescale.
      </p>
    
      <h3>Discuss Your Printing Requirements</h3>
    
      <p>
        Planning an exhibition, updating your existing
        graphics, or looking for professional signage?
        <strong>Get in touch with Trevor</strong> to
        discuss your project and explore the options
        available.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Ask for Trevor when calling, or email
        <a href="mailto:trevor@efexacademy.com">
          trevor@efexacademy.com
        </a>
        with your requirements.
      </p>
    </section>


    <section class="row text-center image-content">
      <div class="col-12">
        <img src={asset('assets/images/9.large-print/image1.jpg')} alt="Portable modular exhibition stand setup at a conference" />
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
